    3,
    'Framework: SFIA 9
Skill: Financial analysis (FIAN)
Category: Strategy and architecture > Financial and value management
Level: 3

Overall Description:
Conducting in-depth analysis of financial data to derive insights and support decision-making.

Level 3 Description:
Applies established financial analysis techniques and processes to carry out specific tasks such as detailed data analysis, report generation and interpretation of financial metrics. _x000D_
Contributes to the development of actionable insights for decision-making._x000D_
Communicates financial analysis findings to relevant stakeholders.

Guidance:
Activities may include, but are not limited to:_x000D_
_x000D_
