    3,
    'Framework: SFIA 9
Skill: Offensive cyber operations (OCOP)
Category: Delivery and operation > Security services
Level: 3

Overall Description:
Plans, executes and manages offensive cybersecurity operations, including target selection, electronic target folders and post-operation analysis.

Level 3 Description:
Carries out specific tasks within offensive cyber operations, aligning operational tasks with broader objectives._x000D_
Supports the creation and maintenance of electronic target folders, gathering and verifying target information. _x000D_
Assists in the execution of operations, maintaining operational security. _x000D_
Prepares detailed reports and participates in post-operation analysis.

